<Track #prepare-halfcode-03-kind-contract-release apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" version="1" { status = "completed" goal = "把 Halfcode 0.3 exact resource envelope、versioned Kind contract 与公开 npm distribution 收敛为可供 Holarchy/Eidolon 真实消费的发布候选。" description = "验证现有 0.3 实现的 contract authority、公开 exports、核心矩阵、tarball 边界与隔离 consumer；生成可审计候选证据并只做发布准备。" question_mode = "decision-tree" question_severity = "auto" commit_mode = "manual" created_at = "2026-09-04T09:17:41.718Z" updated_at = "2026-09-04T09:30:57.814Z" modeling_base_commit = "7b08da0c024c6bb204778ccc9d7547648ab1a8fd" engineering_base_commit = "7b08da0c024c6bb204778ccc9d7547648ab1a8fd" } (
  <Ports { scope = "track" } [
    <MaterialBundle #resource_contract { role = "input" name = "resource-contract" domain = "code" path = "vfs://@/packages/resource-core/" }>
    <MaterialBundle #kind_contract { role = "input" name = "kind-contract" domain = "code" path = "vfs://@/packages/kind-definition/" }>
    <MaterialBundle #distribution { role = "output" name = "distribution" domain = "artifact" path = "vfs://@/packages/distribution/" }>
    <MaterialBundle #reports { role = "output" name = "reports" domain = "artifact" path = "vfs://./reports/" }>
  ]>
  <TaskSpace #space_prepare-halfcode-03-kind-contract-release { name = "prepare-halfcode-03-kind-contract-release" version = "1" child_mode = "dag" } (
    <SubNodes [
      <TaskGroup #P1 { name = "0.3 contract authority" status = "DONE" priority = "P0" order = 0 } (
        <SubNodes [
          <Task #P1-T1 { name = "复核 exact envelope 与 versioned Kind contract" status = "DONE" priority = "P0" order = 0 } (
            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion #P1-T1-AC1 { checked = true } ?01M1NVN0YMCBJC6GDVQV9MRZ1G>
              公开 `RESOURCE_ENVELOPE_CONTRACT/FINGERPRINT` 与 Kind owner/spec/reader registrations 由确定性代码生成并在根入口和子路径保持同一 identity。
              </?01M1NVN0YMCBJC6GDVQV9MRZ1G>
              <Criterion #P1-T1-AC2 { checked = true } ?01M1NVN0YMCBJC6GDVQV9MRZ1H>
              loader 拒绝 legacy `apiVersion/version/currentApiVersion` authority，且 description 中的 SpecRevision fingerprints 必须与 admitted code contract 精确一致。
              </?01M1NVN0YMCBJC6GDVQV9MRZ1H>
              <Criterion #P1-T1-AC3 { checked = true } ?01M1NVN0YMCBJC6GDVQV9MRZ1J>
              envelope、loader、Kind registry/resolution 的正反例测试全部通过，不能以 test-only fingerprint 放宽物理 gate。
              </?01M1NVN0YMCBJC6GDVQV9MRZ1J>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
      <TaskGroup #P2 { name = "npm distribution candidate" status = "DONE" priority = "P0" order = 1 } (
        <SubNodes [
          <Task #P2-T1 { name = "构建并隔离消费 halfcode-compiler.xnl@0.3.0 tarball" status = "DONE" priority = "P0" order = 0 } (
            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion #P2-T1-AC1 { checked = true } ?01M1NVN0YMCBJC6GDVQV9MRZ1K>
              distribution build/check、十个公开 specifier runtime/types、内置 Resource DSL bytes 与 tarball 边界全部通过。
              </?01M1NVN0YMCBJC6GDVQV9MRZ1K>
              <Criterion #P2-T1-AC2 { checked = true } ?01M1NVN0YMCBJC6GDVQV9MRZ1M>
              隔离 consumer 只安装本地 tarball，也能读取公开 envelope/Kind authority 并执行真实 resource loader/resolver。
              </?01M1NVN0YMCBJC6GDVQV9MRZ1M>
              <Criterion #P2-T1-AC3 { checked = true } ?01M1NVN0YMCBJC6GDVQV9MRZ1N>
              候选报告记录 name/version/integrity/shasum/size，且未执行 npm publish 或 dist-tag mutation。
              </?01M1NVN0YMCBJC6GDVQV9MRZ1N>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
      <TaskGroup #P3 { name = "联合迁移交接" status = "DONE" priority = "P0" order = 2 } (
        <SubNodes [
